---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Split Easy - Support"
  description="Need help with Split Easy?"
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/split-easy/support"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-8">Support</h1>
        <div class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-12">
          <p class="text-lg mb-4">Need help with Split Easy?</p>
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Split%20Easy%20Support" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a> for help with split math, uneven shares, or share card exports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">How do uneven splits work?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Turn on per-person custom amounts when creating a split so each person can pay the amount they actually owe.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Can I share results with my group?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Yes. Split Easy generates a share card image you can send through Messages, Slack, or text.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Does it save split history?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Splits are saved in-app so you can reference and review prior expenses anytime.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Is internet required?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">No. You can calculate splits and save a split without network access.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
